V9 report presentation

render.js, templates/report.html and the generated template.js are relocated from @aihq/core
(samartomar/aih-core, src/harness/report/render.mjs and src/harness/report/templates/report.html
at commit faa19b50b9f6c528053c2cdab71b92c99beb01f4, template source SHA-256
f579f499b68c414baeeaa508f7199e33b5ba182a832b3e4f83ad6b395253bdca). This is an ownership move of
presentation into the Workbench; Core keeps the snapshot data, validation, redaction and claims.
